    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "NUE\nORLEANS\nLA HAVANE\nMIAMI\nNASSAU\nNANTO\nDOMINGOI\nMEXICO S\n*HEUBL\n/HONDURASLA\nO BELIZE)\nPORT\nAU PRINCE\nICEGALPA\nJAMAICAL!\nGUATEMALA O\nSUATEMALAL\nIL SALVADOR SALVADOR\nI COSTA RIGAT\nPANAMA\nMANAGUA\nPANAMA\nPBOGOTAO\nQUITO C\nEQUATEUR\nRÉR DOMİNİCAIN\nPUERTO RICOTO ST. MAARTENTI\nANTIGUAN\nTST. LUCIAH\nLEUA BELOUPE\nMARTINI QUL\n[BARBADOSI\nTRINITED\nCARACAS\nNEZUELA\nGUYANE BRITTANIQU\nBiE L\nGUYANE FRANSAISELL\nRASIL\nLIMA\n3 PARAGUAY\nASUNCIONE\nRIO DE JANEIRO\nSÃO PAULO\nFLAMERIQUE\nAliNE\n800\nHiL\nURUGUAY\n• MONTEVIDEO\nBUENOS\nAIRES\nLiness\nLio:",
      "THE\nPRESIDENT\nBOiSSONS\nSherry\nDubonnet\nAPERTiES\nCampari\nDry Vermouth\nBloody Mary\nVodka Martini\nCOCKTAiLS\nManhattan\nScrewdriver\nMartini\nWhiskey Sour\nDaiquiri\nScotch\nWHiSKiES\nBourbon\nCanadian\nGin and Tonic\nTom Collins\nVodka Collins\nGin\nVodka\nBeer and Sott Drinks\nNOTRE SELEĆTION DES GRANDS VINS DE FRANCE\nOUR\nSELECTION OF VINTAGE FRENCH WINES\nBourgogne Blanc Tête de Cuvee\nBordeaux Rouge Grand Crû classé\nWHITE BURGUNDY\nRED BORDEAUX\nChampagne Brut Millésimé-Cuvée spéciale pour Pan American\nCHAMPAGNE SPECIALLY SELECTED FOR PAN AMERICAN\nCrème de Menthe\nBenédictine and Brandy\nLiQUEURS\nBénédictine\nVSOP Cognac\nCointreau\nDrambuie\nRefreshments available throughout your flight\nRum",
      "SPECIAL\nDiNER\nLe Caviar Malossol de la Caspienne\nCAVIAR MALOSSOL FROM THE CASPIAN\nSEA\nVodka ou Champagne\nHORS D'OEUVRE\nLes savoureuses Spécialités de tous Pays\nSPECIALTIES FROM VARIOUS COUNTRIES\nBourgogne Blanc\nPoTAGE\nLe Consommé de Queue de Boeuf à l'Armagnac\nCLEAR\nOX-TAIL SOUP WITH ARMAGNAC\nLes Paillettes dorées au Paprika\nPUFF PASTE STICKS WITH PAPRIKA\nENIPEES\nLa Côte de Boeuf rôtie\nROAST RIB EYE OF BEEF\nBordeaux Rouge\nLe Médaillon de Veau à l'Estragon\nVEAL STEAK WITH\nTARRAGON SAUCE\nBordeaux Rouge\nLe Canard aux Pêches\nDUCK WITH PEACHES\nBordeaux Rouge\nLes Filets de Sole sautés Amandine\nFILLETS OF SOLE WITH ALMONDS\nBourgogne Blanc\nLe Sauté d'Agneau au Curry de Madras\nMADRAS LAMB CURRY\nBordeaux Rouge\nL'Aiguillette de Boeuf Tastevin\nBRAISED SIRLOIN BUTT OF BEEF TASTEVIN\nBordeaux Rouge\nLes Petits Pois au Beurre\nBUTTERED PEAS\nLe Riz Pilaff aux Champignons\nPILAFF RICE WITH MUSHROOMS\nFROMAGES\nLa Sélection de Fromages de Pays\nSELECTION OF CHEESE\nBordeaux Rouge\nDESSERT\nLe Gâteau Saint Honoré\nGATEAU SAINT HONORE\nChampagne\nUn Choix de Fruits des Iles et des Continents\nFRUIT BASKET\nCafé Américain\nAMERICAN COFFEE\nCafé Sanka\nSANKA COFFEE\nThe Orange Pekoe\nORANGE PEKOE TEA\nLiqueurs\nPAN AMERiCAN CUiSINE BY MAXiNS DE PARiS\n\"La bonne Cuisine est la base du véritable bonheur. \"'A. Escoffier\n\"GOOD FOOD IS THE BASIS FOR TRUE HAPPINESS\"",
      "MAP COPYRIGHT 1951 PAN AMERICAN WORLD AIRWAYS, INC. -FROM \"SAVOIR-VIVRE INTERNATIONAL\", ODE PARIS, REVISED 1964\nDIETARY NEEDS • RELIGIOUS PREFERENCES\nSpecial meals can be provided for passengers who require them for\ndietary needs or religious preferences, if advised in advance.\nFor the Roman Catholic passenger on Pan\nAmerican, a special dispensation has been granted\nby the Sacred Congregation of the Council whereby they\nare not obligated to abstain from meat on Friday and other days of abstinence.\nOur Kosher meals are prepared, packed under strict Orthodox\nsupervision in accordance with Jewish dietary law.\nLITHO\nUSA-9243•7395\n2016.4°132"
